    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "48 hours seems like a massive amount of time for just a text record to move around. isn't there a way to speed it up or force the servers to recognize the update immediately? it feels like the data is just getting lost or stuck somewhere in the middle.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
